---
# Wyoming-OpenAI Service Dependencies
## Configures service startup dependencies via a systemd-container drop-in file.
## This ensures that required services are running before the container starts,
## allowing the maintainer to manage startup order via drop-in files.

variant: fcos
version: 1.6.0

storage:
  files:
    - path: /etc/containers/systemd/wyoming-openai/wyoming-openai.container.d/dependencies.conf
      overwrite: true
      contents:
        inline: |
          [Unit]
          # Ensure required services are active before starting the container
          After=parakeet.service chatterbox-turbo.service
      user:
        name: root
      group:
        name: root
      mode: 0644
